OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AResidents leave devastated
OL,4,ARussian-occupied Oleshky as evacuation
OL,5,Acorridor opens
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe residents of Oleshky who wish to
OL,8,Fleave have a four-hour window to do so.
OL,9,FAn evacuation convoy of 25 buses will
OL,10,Fallow up to 750 people to leave Oleshky
OL,11,Funtil 14:00 (12:00 GMT), along with
OL,12,Fambulances for people with limited
OL,13,Fmobility.
OL,15,FIt is understood several hundred people
OL,16,Fhave decided to stay in the town,
OL,17,Fdespite the widespread devastation and
OL,18,Fthe lack of gas, electricity and
OL,19,Frunning water.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
